# Figentra Flow publishes as @figentra/flow to the Figentra registry first (owner, 2026-10-31: npmjs's `figentra`
# name is held for about 30 days); it goes public on npmjs as `figentra-flow` later.
@figentra:registry=https://npm.stackra.figentra.com/
# The @stackra scope resolves from the Stackra registry only (ADR 0453); never npmjs.
@stackra:registry=https://npm.stackra.figentra.com/
